WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.905 --> 00:00:10.925
Hello?

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.075
Is anyone there?

00:00:20.995 --> 00:00:22.195
I'm trying to reach...

00:00:28.355 --> 00:00:29.355
I repeat *static* is anyone out there?

00:00:43.785 --> 00:00:44.785
*Godzilla growl*

00:00:50.685 --> 00:00:53.335
Senators, we believe that these..

00:00:53.335 --> 00:00:56.405
"Titans", are just the tip of the iceberg.

00:00:56.405 --> 00:00:57.405
*Godzilla growls*

00:00:57.405 --> 00:00:59.405
*Godzilla roars*

00:01:04.505 --> 00:01:07.245
Which of these titans are here to protect us?

00:01:07.245 --> 00:01:08.935
*Godzilla snarls*

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.825
*Mothra sings*

00:01:10.825 --> 00:01:11.325
*Rodan screams*

00:01:11.325 --> 00:01:13.325
And which of these titans are here to threaten us.

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:22.300
*King Ghidorah growls and stirs*

00:01:23.255 --> 00:01:26.295
So you'd want to make Godzilla our pet?

00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:27.115
*Laughter among the senators*

00:01:27.115 --> 00:01:30.425
No. We would be his.

00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:36.245
You sure he's gonna be ok?

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.200
*Godzilla snarls*

00:01:45.065 --> 00:01:46.065
They're everywhere

00:01:47.245 --> 00:01:48.555
Battling for dominance

00:01:49.515 --> 00:01:51.285
A rival alpha to Godzilla

00:01:55.065 --> 00:01:56.265
You gotta be kiddin'

00:01:56.265 --> 00:01:58.265
*King Ghidorah shrieks. Mothra sings*

00:01:58.265 --> 00:02:00.265
*Godzilla growls*

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.200
*King Ghidorah snarls*

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:11.200
Oh sh--

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.200
*GODZILLA BELLOWS*

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.200
*KING GHIDORAH ROARS*

